1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MESTWIN [Mszczuj] (-25 Dec 1294).  "Swantopolcus…dux Pomoranorum" confirmed donations to Kloster Oliva, made by "patris nostri domini Mistwi seu patrui nostri Samborii et filii eius Sobizlai sive etiam fratrum nost
2 CONC rorum Samborii et Raciborii", by charter dated 9 Aug 1235, witnessed by "Mistwi filius meus…"[343].  "Swantopolcus…dux Pomeranie" donated property to Kloster Dargun, with the consent of "collateralis nostre Ermegardis ac…Mestwini 
2 CONC et Wartislai filiorum nostrorum", by charter dated 5 Apr 1252 witnessed by "dux Rattiburius frater noster…"[344].  "Mistwinus…dux Scwecensis" divided his expectations in land, which he would inherit after the deaths of "patre nost
2 CONC ro et a fratre", with "nostro consanguineo domino Barnim…Slauorum duci" by charter dated 20 Sep 1264[345].  He succeeded his father in 1266 as MESTWIN II Duke of Pommerellen [Pomorze].  The Chronicon Terræ Prussiæ of Peter von Dus
2 CONC burg records the death in 1266 of "Swantepolcus dux Pomeranie" and the subsequent rebellion of "Mestowinus primogenitus eius" against the Teutonic Order[346].  "Mysciwus…dux tocius Pomoranie" granted property to "comitis Csyborii"
2 CONC  by charter dated 1 Jun 1266[347].  Herzog von Schwetz [Świecie].  He nominated Przemysł II Duke of Greater Poland as his successor in Pomorze[348].  m firstly ([1253/55]) JUTTA von Wettin, daughter of DIETRICH [I] Graf von Brehna
2 CONC  & his wife Eudoxia of Mazovia [Piast] (-[1269/73]).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.   1267.  m secondly (1275, divorced before Aug 1288) as her second husband, EUPHROSYNE
2 CONC  [Eufrozyna] von Oppeln, widow of KAZIMIERZ Prince of Kujavia [Piast], daughter of KASIMIR Duke of Oppeln [Piast] & his wife Viola --- ([1228/30]-4 Nov 1292).  "Dominus Mstywg…dux Pomoranie…cum…coniuge nostra Effrosina" donated pr
2 CONC operty to the church of St John the Baptist at Sworinagatz for a new monastery by charter dated 1275[349].  "Evfrosina…ducissa Kuiauie, Lanchicie et Syradie relicta…ducis Kazimiii dictarum terrarum quondam domini" donated property
2 CONC  received from "dux Pomoranie dominus Mstiugius" to Gnesen by charter dated 27 Oct 1292[350].  m thirdly (26 Aug 1288) SULISLAWA [Sulka], daughter of ---.  Her marriage is confirmed by the charter dated 1292 under which her husban
2 CONC d "Mestwinus…dux Pomeranorum" granted property to "Janikoni nepoti uxoris nostre…domine Sulislaue"[351].  Mestwin & his first wife had one child:  (a)       KATHARINA (-after 1 Jan 1312). 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I30440&tree=2
