1 NOTE {geni:about_me} nævnt 1351-67, besad borgen Arnsholm i Arrild Sogn syd for Ribe, tjente 1351 halvbroderen hertug Valdemar, men fra 1352/53 svogeren Valdemar Atterdag fra 1353/56 som staller i Frisland, slået til rid­der 1360/61, n
2 CONC ævnt 1361(63)-67 som høvedsmand på Riberhus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans seglomskrift 3 lyder S’WALDEMARI ERICS’, og i to senere fremdragne breve af pave Innocens 6. fra 1355 7/94 siges han at være en naturlig søn (natus) af hertug Erik (1312—1325). 
2 CONT
2 CONT mentioned 1351-67, possessed the castle Arnsholm in Arrild parish south of Ribe, served 1351 half-brother Duke Valdemar, but from 1352/53 his brother-in-law Valdemar Atterdag from 1353/56 as staller in Frisia, knighted 1360/61, me
2 CONC ntioned 1361(63)-67 as chieftain at Riberhus.
2 CONT
2 CONT His seal inscription 3 reads S'WALDEMARI ERICS', and in two later letters of Pope Innocent 6 from 1355 7/94 he is said to be a natural son (natus) of Duke Eric (1312—1325).
