2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jadwiga (Polish)/Hedwig (German)/Hedvig (Hungarian). 
2 CONT Born between 3 October 1373 and 18 February 1374, died July 17, 1399 after childbirth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Names as "Hedwig" after her fifth great grandmother: [https://www.geni.com/people/St-Hedwig-von-Andechs-Patron-Saint-of-Silesia/4774053172420033191 St. Hedwig of Silesia].
2 CONT
2 CONT King (Qieen) of Poland  Reign 16 October 1384 – 17 July 1399  Coronation 16 October 1384 in the Wawel Cathedral, Kraków  Predecessor Louis I  Successor Władysław II Jagiełło 
2 CONT
