2 CONT
2 CONT Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #5363, d. 15 May 1388
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.39%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen was the son of Rudolf I Herzog von Sachsen-Wittenberg and Kunigarde of Poland. He married Cecilia di Carrara, daughter of Francis di Carrara, Duca di Padua, in 1367. He died on 15 May 1388.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen gained the title of Herzog von Braunschweig-Lüneburg. He gained the title of Kurfürst von Sachsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen and Cecilia di Carrara
