1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Bogusław IX, Duke of Pomerania=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Herzog Bogislaw VIII von Pommern and Duchess of Pomerania Sophia von Holstein
2 CONT * [http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bogus%C5%82aw_IX '''Bogusław IX'''] – '''książę stargardzki i słupski''' z dynastii Gryfitów. Syn księcia stargardzkiego Bogusława VIII i księżniczki holsztyńskiej Zofii. Rezydował w Stargardzie.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  (24 Jun 1432) '''MARIA of Mazovia,''' daughter of SIEMOWIT IV Duke of Mazovia [Piast] & his wife Aleksandra of Lithuania''' ([1410-18 Feb 1454).  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/POMERANIA.htm#BogislawVIIIdied1418 Project MedLands POMERANIA]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''BOGISLAW von Pommern''' ([1407/10]-7 Dec 1446).  '''He succeeded his father in 1418 as BOGISLAW IX Duke of Pomerania in Stargard.'''  married (24 Jun 1432) MARIA of Mazovia, daughter of SIEMOWIT IV Duke of Mazovia [Piast] & his
2 CONC  wife Aleksandra of Lithuania ([1410-18 Feb 1454).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Bogusław IX & his wife MARIA had two children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * (a)       '''SOPHIE''' ([1435]-[24 Aug 1494/1497]).  married  (1451 after Feb) as his second wife, '''ERICH II Duke of Pomerania in Wolgast,''' son of WARTISLAW IX Duke of Pomerania & his wife Sophie von Sachsen-Lauenburg ([1418
2 CONC /25]-Wolgast 5 Jul 1474). 
2 CONT * (b)       '''ALEXANDRA''' (-1451). 
2 CONT
