2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Somebody's gotten at least two Alanas mixed up. This one was related to Queen Anne of Bohemia.
2 CONT
2 CONT "By his wife Alana, daughter of one Barrey of Wales, who survived him till 1456 (Cal. Inq. post mortem, iv. 276), he had two sons and two daughters (Harl. MS. 381, f. 168; Visit. Bedfordshire, p. 198; Visit. Norfolk, p. 304)."
2 CONT
