2 CONT '''Euphemia von Munsterberg was born between 1370 and 1385 at of Oppeln, Silesia, Prussia.3 She married Frederick III, Graf von Oettingen''', son of Ludwig XI, Count von Oettingen and Imagina von Schauenburg, '''before 24 March 13
2 CONC 95.3,2 Euphemia von Munsterberg died on 17 November 1447.'''3,2
2 CONT '''Family	Frederick III, Graf von Oettingen''' d. 23 Jan 1423
