1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Henryk IX Starszy''' (literally Henry IX the Older) (b. probably between 1387 and 1392, d 11 November 1467 in Krosno) was a Duke of Żagań-Głogów during 1397–1412 (as co-ruler of his brother), during 1412–17 rule
2 CONC r over Szprotawa, Krosno Odrzańskie, Świebodzin and half of Głogów (with his brothers as co-rulers), since 1417 ruler over Szprotawa, half of Głogów, since 1420 ruler over Kożuchów and Zielona Góra, from 1430 ruler over Krosno Odr
2 CONC zańskie and Świebodzin and since 1446 Duke of Lubin. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henryk_IX_Starszy Wikipedia EN]
