1 NAME John III "the Pitiless" Duke of Bavaria-Straubing, Count of Holland, Bishop of Liege
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC St. Vincent, 's Gravenhage, Zuid Holland, Netherlands
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
