2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg, Prince of Grubenhagen:''' Reign 1383-1427
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/F%C3%BCrst-Albrecht-II-von-Braunschweig-Grubenhagen-Salzerhelden/6000000003827363845 Albert I] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-III-Herzog-von-Braunschweig-Grube
2 CONC nhagen/6000000006727823730 Henry III]
2 CONT
