1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir Thomas Tyndale (son of Sir William Tyndale and Alana Felbrigg) was born 1423 in Dene, Northamptonshire, England, and died 1451 in Breisworth Manor, Suffolk, England.. He married Margaret Yelverton in Dene, Nort
2 CONC hahptonshire, England, daughter of William Yelverton and Joane Agnes Le Gross.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Includes NotesNotes for Sir Thomas Tyndale: Another birth date is About 1415. Another death date is 1448.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Sir Thomas Tyndale and Margaret Yelverton: Marriage: Dene, Northahptonshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Thomas Tyndale and Margaret Yelverton are:
2 CONT
