2 CONT '''     Marie de Valois-Bourgogne was born in 1394.2 She was the daughter of''' Jean I de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne and Marguerite von Bayern-Straubing.1 '''She married Adolf I Graf von der Mark Herzog von Kleve und Graf van Ravens
2 CONC berg''', son of Adolf III Graf von der Mark Graf von Kleve und Kurfürst von Köln and Margareta von Jülich-Berg, '''in 1406.1 She died in 1473.1 She was also reported to have died on 30 October 1463 at Castle Monterberg, Kalkar, Ge
2 CONC rmany.'''2
2 CONT '''Children of Marie de Valois-Bourgogne and Adolf I Graf von der Mark Herzog von Kleve und Graf van Ravensberg'''
