2 CONC nton); Josse; & Sir Charles, Duke of Burgundy, Lorraine, Brabant, Limburg, & Luxembourg).1,2,3,4 '''Philip III 'the Good', Duke of Burgundy, Lorraine, Brabant, & Limburg, Count of Flanders, Artois, Hainault, Holland, Zeeland, & Na
2 CONC mur died on 15 June 1467 at Brugge, West Flanders, Flanders, Belgium, at age 70; Buried at Chartreuse de Champmol, Dijon, France.1,2
