1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Agnes of Burgundy (1407 – 1 December 1476), duchess of Bourbon (Bourbonnais) and Auvergne, countess of Clermont, was the daughter''' of John the Fearless (1371–1419) and Margaret of Bavaria.[1] '''Her maternal g
2 CONC randparents''' were Albert I, Duke of Bavaria and Margaret of Brieg. '''Her paternal grandparents''' were Philip the Bold and Margaret III, Countess of Flanders.
2 CONT Life
2 CONT '''Agnes spent much of her youth in the company of her mother''', Margaret of Bavaria, and sisters Margaret of Burgundy and Anne of Burgundy.[2] '''She was well educated and a life-long reader,[3][4] involved in politics until the
2 CONC  last years of her life.[4]
2 CONT '''Marriage and issue'''
2 CONT '''Agnes married Charles I, Duke of Bourbon.[5] They had:'''
2 CONT *John of Bourbon (1426–1488), Duke of Bourbon[1]
2 CONT *Marie de Bourbon (1428–1448), married in 1444 John II, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT *Philip of Bourbon (1430–1440), Lord of Beaujeu
2 CONT *Charles of Bourbon (Château de Moulins 1434–1488, Lyon), Cardinal and Archbishop of Lyon[1] and Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT *Isabella of Bourbon (1436–1465), married Charles, Duke of Burgundy.[1]
2 CONT *Peter of Bourbon, (1438–1503, Château de Moulins), Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT *Louis of Bourbon (1438 – 30 August 1482, murdered), Prince-Bishop of Liège[1]
2 CONT *Margaret of Bourbon (5 February 1439 – 1483, Château du Pont-Ains), married in Moulins on 6 April 1472 Philip II, Duke of Savoy,[5] parents of Louise of Savoy
2 CONT *Catherine of Bourbon (Liège, 1440 – 21 May 1469, Nijmegen), married on 28 December 1463 in Bruges Adolf II, Duke of Guelders[1]
2 CONT *Joanna of Bourbon (1442–1493, Brussels), married in Brussels in 1467 John II of Chalon, Prince of Orange
2 CONT *Jacques of Bourbon (1445–1468, Bruges), Count of Montpensier. Unmarried
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agnes_of_Burgundy,_Duchess_of_Bourbon
2 CONT '''Agnes of Burgundy'''
2 CONT '''Duchess consort of Bourbon'''
2 CONT '''Tenure	1434-1456'''
2 CONT '''Born	1407'''
2 CONT '''Died	1 December 1476 (aged 68–69)'''
2 CONT '''Spouse	Charles I, Duke of Bourbon'''
2 CONT '''Issue'''	
2 CONT John II, Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT Mary, Duchess of Lorraine
2 CONT Philip, Lord of Beaujeu
2 CONT Charles II, Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT Isabella, Countess of Charolais
2 CONT Peter II, Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT Louis, Prince-Bishop of Liège
2 CONT Margaret, Duchess of Savoy
2 CONT Catherine, Duchess of Guelders
2 CONT Joanna, Princess of Orange
2 CONT Jacques, Count of Montpensier
2 CONT House	Valois-Burgundy
