2 CONT '''     Agnes of Burgundy was born in 1407. She married Charles, Duke of Bourbon, Duke d'Auvergne, Grand Marshal of France, Governor of Languedoc, Count of Clermont''', son of Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de 
2 CONC Clermont & Montpensier and Marie du Berry, '''on 17 September 1425. Agnes of Burgundy died on 1 December 1476'''.
