2 CONT
2 CONT ALBERT II OF GERMANY Albert the Magnanimous KG, elected King of the Romans as Albert II (10 August 1397 – 27 October 1439) was king of the Holy Roman Empire and a member of the House of Habsburg. By inheritance he became Albert V,
2 CONC  Duke of Austria.
