1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jobst_II,_Count_of_Hoya en.wikipedia...] ; 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Jobst II, Graf von Hoya (1493-1545)===
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the eldest son of Count Jobst I and his wife, Ermengarde of Lippe. After the early death of his father in 1507, a regency council was formed, consisting of the Count of Spiegelberg, the Lord of Diepholz and his mother.
2 CONT
2 CONT His younger brother John VII entered into Swedish service and became governor of Vyborg. His brother Eric IV inherited the Stolzenau section of the County. His sisters Anna and Elisabeth were canonesses of Vreden Abbey and Essen A
2 CONC bbey.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT War  von 1511 bis 1545 regierender Graf von Hoya.
2 CONT * Seine kinderlose Söhne regierten nach einander der Grafschaft bis mit Ott 1582 die Dynastie ausstarb.
2 CONT
