1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bogus%C5%82aw_X_Wielki '''Bogusław X Wielki'''] Bogislaw X Herzog von Pommern-Wolgast (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #114710, b. 3 June 1454, d. 5 October 1523
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=14 May 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT      Bogislaw X Herzog von Pommern-Wolgast was born on 3 June 1454. He was the son of Eric II Herzog von Pommern-Wolgast. (1) He married, firstly, Margarete Prinzessin von Brandenburg, daughter of Friedrich II Kurfürst von Branden
2 CONC burg and Katherine von Sachsen, circa 20 February 1477. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Anne Jagellon, daughter of Casimir IV Jagellon, King of Poland and Elisabeth von Habsburg, on 2 February 1491. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 5 October 1523 at age 69.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Bogislaw X Herzog von Pommern-Wolgast succeeded to the title of Herzog von Pommern in 1478. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Bogislaw X Herzog von Pommern-Wolgast and Margarete Prinzessin von Brandenburg
2 CONT
