1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Count Kraft VI of Hohenlohe-Weikersheim (c. 1445 in Neuenstein – 2 August 1503 in Neuenstein) was a German nobleman who served as a canon in Mainz and Speyer.
2 CONT '''His parents were''' Kraft V, Count of Hohenlohe-Weikersheim, and Margaret of Oettingen.
2 CONT '''Marriage and issue'''
2 CONT '''On 26 February 1476, Kraft VI married Helena of Württemberg''' (c. 1455 - 19 February 1506), daughter of Ulrich V, Count of Württemberg. '''Helena brought 8,000 guilders into the marriage as her dowry. With her husband's contri
2 CONC bution and the morning gift, she had a fortune that, through interest, led to an annual income of around 1,600 guilders, which enabled her to live a life befitting her status. Through her origins, she contributed significantly to 
2 CONC the prestige of the House of Hohenlohe.'''
2 CONT '''Helena was almost always pregnant during their marriage, giving birth to eighteen children in just 24 years, but only eleven lived to mature adulthood''':
2 CONT *Albert III (1478 - 19 August 1551)
2 CONT *Margaret (30 July 1480 - 3 September 1522)
2 CONT *Kraft Ulrich (1481 - unknown), died in childhood.
2 CONT *Helena (4 February 1483 - 31 March 1483), died in infancy.
2 CONT *Friedrich (19 April 1484 - 1503), a Canon in Mainz and Speyer, died in adolescence.
2 CONT *Siegmund (9 August 1485 - 8 August 1534), a Canon in Straßburg and Augsburg
2 CONT *Ludwig (10 November 1486 - 18 November 1550), a Canon in Mainz, Speyer and Straßburg
2 CONT *George I (17 January 1488 - 16 March 1551)
2 CONT *Philipp (20 June 1489 - unknown), died in childhood.
2 CONT *Helena (21 September 1490 - 6 April 1543), a nun at Lichtenstern in 1512. She later became the Abbess at Gnadental.
2 CONT *Philipp (19 September 1492 - 2 March 1541), killed in a duel.
2 CONT *Katharina (25 November 1494 - 1536), a nun at Kirchheim am Ries in 1506.
2 CONT *Elisabeth (24 November 1495 - 1540)
2 CONT *Klara (27 May 1497 - 13 August 1514), died young. She was a nun at Steinhelm in 1510.
2 CONT *Johann (27 July 1499 - 1540), who held the office of Treasurer of Kapfenburg between 1527 and 1538.
2 CONT *Klara Anna (1500 - 1534)
2 CONT *Christian (1502 - 1502), died in infancy.
2 CONT *Ulrich (1502 - 1502), died in infancy.
2 CONT From: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kraft_VI,_Count_of_Hohenlohe-Weikersheim
2 CONT
