2 CONT ==Kraft VI Graf von Hohenlohe-Waldenburg-Neuenstein1 
2 CONT '''M, #107495, b. before 1472, d. 2 August 1503'''
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Nov 2011
2 CONT '''Kraft VI Graf von Hohenlohe-Waldenburg-Neuenstein was born before 1472.1 He was the son''' of Kraft V Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim and Margareta von Oettingen.1 '''He married Helena von Württemberg''', daughter of Ulrich V Gr
2 CONC af von Württemberg and Margherita Principessa di Savoia-Achaea, '''on 26 February 1476 at Waldenburg, GermanyG.1 He died on 2 August 1503.1 He was buried at Stiftskirche, Öhringen, Germany'''G.1
2 CONT '''He was a member of the House of Hohenlohe.'''1
