2 CONT ==Graf Kraft VI. zu Hohenlohe
2 CONT '''Birth	1442'''
2 CONT '''Neuenstein, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT '''Death	2 Aug 1503 (aged 60–61)'''
2 CONT '''Öhringen, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Stiftskirche St. Peter und Paul'''
2 CONT '''Öhringen, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 158558267
2 CONT '''When Count Kraft VI of Hohenlohe was born in 1442, in Neuenstein, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany, his father''', Kraft V, Graf von Hohenlohe, was 26 and his mother, Margaret Von Oettingen, was 31. '''He married Hele
2 CONC ne Grafin Von Wurttemberg on 26 February 1476, in Waldenburg, Öhringen, Württemberg, Germany. He was a canon priest in Mainz and also in Speyer. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 6 daughters. He died on 2 August 1503, i
2 CONC n Öhringen, Öhringen, Württemberg, Germany, at the age of 61.'''
