2 CONT Maximilian I, Holy Roman Emperor
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign 1508 - 1519 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Mary, Duchess of Burgundy
2 CONT
2 CONT Bianca Maria Sforza 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Frederick III 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Eleanor of Portugal 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born March 22, 1459
2 CONT
