1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob, Margrave of Baden-Baden
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 25 July 1422 Catherine of Lorraine, daughter of Charles II, Duke of Lorraine and Margaret of the Palatinate. They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles I, Margrave of Baden-Baden (d. 24 February 1475, Pforzheim).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard II, Margrave of Baden-Baden (later beatified) (1428–12 July 1458, Moncalieri).
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann (1430–9 February 1503, Ehrenbreitstein), Archbishop of Trier.
2 CONT
2 CONT George (1433–11 February 1484, Moyen), Bishop of Metz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Markus (1434–1 September 1478), abbot in Liège.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarete (1431–24 October 1457, Ansbach), married 1446 to Albert III, Margrave of Brandenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilde (d. 1485), Abbess of Trier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles II, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT From his marriage to Margaret of the Palatinate (1376–1434), daughter of Rupert of Germany and Elisabeth of Nuremberg, in 1394, only two daughters survived childhood:
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella (1400–1453), who became Duchess on his death and married René, later holder of many prestigious titles
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Ralph, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine (1407–1439), married Jacob, Margrave of Baden
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katharina_von_Lothringen
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina von Lothringen
2 CONT
2 CONT aus Wikipedia, der freien Enzyklopädie
2 CONT
2 CONT Wechseln zu: Navigation, Suche
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina von Lothringen (* 1407; † 1. März 1439) ist die Ehefrau des Markgrafen Jakob I. von Baden
2 CONT
2 CONT Sie ist die Tochter von Herzog Karl II. von Lothringen und der Pfalzgräfin Margarete von der Pfalz und wurde am 1. März 1439 getauft. Sie heiratete am 25. Juli 1422 Jakob I. von Baden. Aus dieser Verbindung gingen folgende Kinder 
2 CONC hervor:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Karl (*;† 24. Februar 1475 in Pforzheim) heiratete 1447 in Pforzheim Katharina von Österreich
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Bernhard (* 1428 in Pforzheim; † 12. Juli 1458 in Moncalieri/Oberitalien), Selig gesprochen.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Johann (* 1430; † 9. Februar 1503 in Ehrenbreitstein)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Georg (* 1433; † 11. Februar 1484 in Moyen), Bischof von Metz
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Markus (* 1434; † 1. September 1478)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Margarete (* 1431; † 24. Oktober 1457 in Ansbach) heiratete 1446 in Heilsbronn Albrecht III.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Mathilde † 1485, Äbtissin in Trier
2 CONT
