2 CONC  l'Ile de France 1476.  Cardinal 18 Dec 1476.  Administrator of the Bishopric of Clermont 10 Mar 1476.  He succeeded his brother in 1488 as Charles II Duc de Bourbon et d'Auvergne.  He resigned his succession at Lyon 15 Apr 1488 t
