2 CONT * Châtelain de Châteauneuf en Forez 12 Apr 1469.  Châtelain de Billy 18 Oct 1471.  His half-brother Duc Jean II invested him as Seigneur de Bois d'Yoin en Lyonnais 9 Oct 1476.  Châtelain of Montmorant and Saint-Bonnet 18 Oct 1478.
2 CONC   He became a priest.  Papal protonotary 1488.
