2 CONT ---
2 CONT Katharina Krzineczky von Ronow (born Zagicz von Hasenburg) was a Bohemian noblewoman from the prominent Zajíc of Házmburk family. She was married to the nobleman Georg (Jiřík) Freiherr Krzineczky von Ronow on Kuncberk (Krinec).---
