1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT 9.  MILES9 HOBART (JAMES8 HUBBARD., THOMAS7 HUBBARD, WILLIAM6, THOMAS5, JOHN4, JEFFREY3 HOBART, JOHN2, JOHN1 HUBBA) was born 1479 in Norwich, Norfolk, England, and died 1558.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married ELLINOR BLAVERHASSET..  She was born 1507 in County of Norfolk, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MILES HOBART:
2 CONT Miles Hobart was born in 1479 in Norwich, Norfolk, England, the son of James and Margery (Lyhart) Hubbard. The County of Norfolk is located on the east coast of England, just north of the county of Suffolk. Miles married Ellinor B
2 CONC laverhasset. She was born in 1507 in the County of Norfolk, England. They were the parents of two sons:
2 CONT "      Thomas Hobart - born 1537 - married Audrey Hare, the daughter of William and Alice (Rugge) Hare - Thomas died January 17, 1599/1600 about 63 years old - direct ancestor
2 CONT "      John Hobart - born about 1539 - died before August 7, 1598, about 59 years old
2 CONT Miles Hobart’s father was Sir James HOBART, born in about 1436 in Monks, Eleigh, Suffolk, England and died February 23, 1517 in Monks, Eleigh, Suffolk, England. His mother was (2) Margery Naunton Lyhart, born in 1440 in Loddon, No
2 CONC rwich, Norfolk, England. and died 1494 in Loddon, Norwich, Norfolk, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MILES HOBART and ELLINOR BLAVERHASSET. are:
2 CONT * 10.              i.    THOMAS10 HUBBARD, b. 1525, Plumsread, Norfolk, England; d. 1555.
2 CONT *                   ii.    JOHN HOBART, b. 1539.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000219255243822&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # “Hubbard History and Genealogy”. Page 38.< [https://ia601301.us.archive.org/25/items/onethousandyears00daye/onethousandyears00daye.pdf PDF] > MILES * HOBART, a descendant of William, was born about 1550, and resided at Plumstead
2 CONC , Norfolk, and also in London. He married Eleanor Blaverhasset, daughter of John, and left sons Sir Miles, John and Thomas.
2 CONT # http://www.myhubbardmtn.com/family%20htm/hubbard.htm
2 CONT # https://www.ancestry.com/boards/surnames.hobart/151?page=1
