2 CONT '''DOROTHEA''' (1516-1572).  Heiress of Falkenburg, Durbuy and Dalem.  Emmius records the marriage arranged in Brussels “ante Eidus Novemb.” 1539 between “comiti Ennoni...fratre Ioanne” and “Dorotheæ” whose dowry was “Durbuyum opp
2 CONC idum...in finibus Lucelburgi principatus...Falcoburgii et Dalæ præfectura in ulteriore ripa Mosæ”[766].  Beninga records the marriage in 1539 of “Graven Johan tho Oostfreeslant” and “Dorothea van Ostenryck, Keyser Maximilians natu
2 CONC erliche dochter”[767].  No reliable indication has been found about the identity of Dorothea’s mother.  m (contract Brussels 11 Nov 1539) JOHANN I “der ältere” Graf von Ostfriesland, son of EDZARD I “der Große” Graf zu Ostfrieslan
2 CONC d & his wife Elisabeth von Rietberg (1506-Schloß Falkenburg 6 Jun 1572). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''from http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/OLDENBURG.htm#Johanndied1572 v4.3 Updated 18 September 2020
