2 CONT * Daughter of Albrecht IV "the Wise", Herzog von Bayern and Kunigunde of Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Duke Ulrich of Württemberg''' in 1511, a union that was unhappy and marked by violence and scandal.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Ulrich: Christoph= 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anna of Württemberg,''' 30 January 1513 in the Old Castle in Stuttgart ; † 29 June 1530 in Urach) was the daughter of Duke Ulrich of Württemberg and his wife Sabina of Bavaria .
2 CONT * '''Christoph (Württemberg) Duke of Württemberg''' (* 12 May 1515 in Urach; † 28 December 1568 in Stuttgart)
