1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Louis''' (16 October 1427 – between 22 May and 16 October 1444), 
2 CONT Marquis of Pont-à-Mousson and Lieutenant General of Lorraine. At the age of five, in 1432, he was sent as a hostage to Dijon with his brother John in exchange for their captive father. John was released, but Louis was not and died
2 CONC  of pneumonia in prison.
2 CONT
