1 OCCU Reina de Castilla y León., Queen Of Spain, Queen of Castile, Queen Consort of Aragon, AKA Isabella the Catholic, Born Aixa; Daughter of the vanquished Arab King Muhammad XII of Granada, known as Boabdil, Queen of Majorca, Naples, 
