2 CONT Eitel Friedrich III Graf von Hohenzollern was born in 1494. He was the son of Eitel Friedrich II Graf von Hohenzollern and Magdalene von Hohenzollern. He married Johanna van Witthem in 1515. He died in 1525.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eitel Friedrich III Graf von Hohenzollern gained the title of Graf von Hohenzollern.
