2 CONT
2 CONT * Married 1568-07-04 [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/4371107?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000088908284960 '''Karin Månsdotter,'''] daughter of the soldier Måns Månsson.  Married on 1567-07-13 Stockholm, Wedding:	1568-07-0
2 CONC 4 Stockholm, Stockholm's Storkyrka  4)	Double wedding: At the same time Erik and Karin married Eriks half sister Sofia with Magnus. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Karin Månsdotter=
