1 NAME Margrethe /Christensdatter Barfod/
2 GIVN Margrethe
2 SURN Christensdatter Barfod
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1476
2 ADDR
3 CITY Them sogn
3 STAE Skanderborg amt
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1570
2 PLAC Tranbjerg
