2 CONT
2 CONT ^ The Bed and The Throne by George R. Marek, page 77
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Marek, The Bed and The Throne, The Life of Isabella d'Este,p.82
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Charles Cawley, Medieval Lands, Dukes of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Francis Hackett Francis The First, p.63
