2 CONT
2 CONT URSULA TYNDALL, 
2 CONT *married in her father's lifetime Richard Gawsell Esq., of Watlington in Norfolk, who died in 1538. (35) 
2 CONT *She married secondly William Butts Esq.., of Shouldham-Thorpe in Norfolk, (36) by whom she had amongst other issue Dr. Henry Butts D.D., the unhappy Master of Corpus Christi College, Cambridgeshire, who committed suicide in 1632.
