3 NOTE A reference to Hanns von Weinsberg in a listing of the retinue of The Palatine Count by the Rhine see page 217:168, at the 1505 Reichstag (section starting on page 206:157).
4 CONT Hanns is here listed as "Hanns herr zu weinsperg des Hilgen Romischen erbkamerer" which would seem to indicate that the chamberlinship had passed to him.
4 CONT Originally from "des Reichstags zu Beschreibung Collen im Jahr 1505. durch Jorg Brandenburg Herolden." reproduced in "Senckenberg, Heinrich Christian von: Sammlung von ungedruckt- und raren Schriften"
