2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 439.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 573.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 166.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 409-410.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 531-532.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 128.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 457-458.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 571-572.
