1 OCCU duque de Beja (3rd, 1484-1495), duque de Viseu (4th, 1484-1495), King of Portugal and do Algarve (1495-1521), Roi du Portugal, Manuel I de Aviz, Rei de Portugal, King of Portugal and Algarves (17.10.1495-1521), sn de Guinee, Manue
