1 NOTE {geni:about_me} = Antoine de Cröy, seigneur de Tours-sur-Marne=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Philippe I de Croÿ, II. comte de Chimay and Walburgis von Moers und Saarwerden
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Antoine I de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, & St. Prat, Governor of La Quesnoy was born in 1460.1 A contract for the marriage of Antoine I de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, & St. Prat, Governor of La Quesnoy 
2 CONC and '''Louise de Luxembourg''' was signed on 5 December 1507.1 Antoine I de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, & St. Prat, Governor of La Quesnoy '''married Anne van der Gracht, daughter of Sir François van der Gracht, Seign
2 CONC eur d'Yseghem & Leeuwerghem, Graf Bailiff of Gand and Antoinette (Antonia) de Stavele, in 1522 or 1523'''.1 Antoine I de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, & St. Prat, Governor of La Quesnoy died in 1546.1
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Louise de Luxembourg d. 18 Apr 1518=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Jacques II de Croy, Seigneur de Sempy, Thou-sur-Marne, St. Prat, Fontaine-l'Eveque, & l'Ecluse'''+1 b. 1508, d. 7 Feb 1587
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Anne van der Gracht=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anne de Croy,''' +1 b. a 1523, d. 26 Jun 1573
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
