2 CONT *'''     Margaret Stewart was born between 1449 and 1463. She was the daughter of James II Stewart, King of Scotland and Marie van Egmont-Gelre.2 She married William Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton, son of James Crichton, 2nd Lord Cri
2 CONC chton and Lady Janet Dunbar.3
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Crichton.3
2 CONT *'''Children of Margaret Stewart and William Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton
