2 CONT With Ercole II she had:
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna d'Este, 16 November 1531 – 1607,[12] married firstly, Francis, Duke of Guise until 1563, married secondly Jacques de Savoie, 2nd Duc de Nemours
2 CONT Alfonso II, Duke of Ferrara, 22 November 1533 – 1597[12]
2 CONT Lucrezia Maria d'Este, 16 December 1535 – 1598,[12] married Francesco Maria II della Rovere, Duke of Urbino.
2 CONT Eleonore d'Este, 1537–1581[12]
2 CONT Luigi d'Este, 21 December 1538 – 1586,[12] Bishop of Ferrara and Archbishop of Auch
2 CONT Renee was widowed in 1559. As a result of being on bad terms with her son, Alfonso, she returned to France in 1560 and settled in Montargis, where she then died on 12 June 1575
