1 CONT was intended  to reconcile the Hungarian and the Angevin claims on Naples.
1 CONT The swarm of Hungarians who followed Andrew to Naples, however, antagonized
1 CONT many of the Angevins at court, including Joan herself. Consequently, when
1 CONT Andrew was assassinated on September 18, 1345, Joan was accused of having
1 CONT been privy to the crime.
