1 CONT and Gorizia) in 1424. He was plagued by conflicts with his relatives and a
1 CONT powerful rebellious nobility throughout his reign, as territories swapped
1 CONT back and forth until 1379 when the two rival branches of the House of Habsburg
1 CONT again united. Austria became a European power when his son's marriage gave
1 CONT the House of Habsburg a large part of the Burgundian domains.
