1 CONT
1 CONT In 1393 Ferdinand married Eleanor of Alburquerque (1374-1435). They had seven children:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Alfonso V of Aragon (1396-1458), king of Aragon, Sicily and Naples
1 CONT     * Maria of Aragon, (1396-1445), queen of Castile, first wife of John II of Castile
1 CONT     * John II of Aragon (1398-1479)
1 CONT     * Henry of Aragon (c. 1400-1445), duke of Villena, count of Alburquerque and Empuries, lord of Sogorb, etc., and grand master of the military Order of Santiago
1 CONT     * Eleanor of Aragon, (1402-1445), queen of Portugal, who married Edward I of Portugal
1 CONT     * Peter of Aragon (1406-1438), count of Alburquerque and duke of Noto
