1 CONT regency to her son Alfonso V who was only six years old when King Edward
1 CONT died by Alfonso's uncle Pedro, Duke de Coimbra. The regency was also
1 CONT challenged by a half-brother, the Duke de Braganca, and was forced to fight,
1 CONT dying at Alfarrobeiro in May 1449.
