0 @N6000000002188309476@ NOTE Margaret of Anjou
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT jeanne (talk) 16:13, 3 April 2008 (UTC)
1 CONT Margaret of Anjou
1 CONT Queen consort of England
1 CONT Margaret of Anjou with King Henry VI
1 CONT Born 23 March 1430
1 CONT Duchy of Lorraine
1 CONT Died 25 August 1482, 63
1 CONT Anjou
