0 @N6000000006444526640@ NOTE Afonso V of Portugal
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT (Redirected from Alphonso V of Portugal)
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Portuguese royalty
1 CONT House of Aviz  
