0 @N6000000004571333244@ NOTE James V (King of Scots) STEWART was born on 10 Apr 1512 in Linlithgow, Lothian SCT. He died on 14 Dec 1542 in Falkland Castle, Fife SCT. He married Margaret ERSKINE (mistress only). 
