0 @N6000000003300556929@ NOTE [FeliMik2.FTW]
1 CONT Thomas WARNER, born 1500 in Great Waltham, Essex, Eng; died April 23, 154 6 in Witham, Essex, England, His Will. He married 16969. Mrs Thomas WARNE R Abt. 1529 in
1 CONT Great Waltham, Essex, , Eng.
1 CONT 16969. Mrs Thomas WARNER, born Abt. 1502 in Of, Great Waltham, Essex, Eng land.
1 CONT Children of Thomas WARNER and Mrs WARNER are:
1 CONT i.
1 CONT Edmund WARNER, born 1532 in Great Waltham, Essex, Eng.
1 CONT ii.
1 CONT Amye WARNER, born 1534 in Great Waltham, Essex, Eng; married Edmund PAYNE
1 CONT 1553 in Essex, England.
1 CONT iii.
1 CONT Johane WARNER, born 1536 in Great Waltham, Essex, Eng; married John PAYNE
1 CONT 1555 in Essex, England.
1 CONT 8484
