1 CONC a toAndrew, and copyhold lands in Hingham to Son Edmund, and the residuary part ofthe estate to "Hellena" (wife) . The copyhold belonged to the Manor of Hingham,Edmund was admitted to the copyhold lands 10 June 1599. Ref; Relation
1 CONC ship; Film No. 547082 Listed as Thomas Hubbard in the Snoring Parish Records. Surnamenot changed till Edmund came to America. Reference to "Audrey Hare" as his wife: The Snoring Magna Parish Records have Hellena , (Wife) as writte
1 CONC n in his Will.
