1 CONT later be succeeded by her half sister, Elizabeth I, only child of Henry's
1 CONT and his 2nd wife, Anne Boleyn. The Archbishop of Canterbury declared
1 CONT Catherine's marriage void to allow Henry to marry his "love", Anne Boleyn.
