0 @N6000000002240799729@ NOTE She was the second wife of Matthias I. Her husband possessed the knowledge of
1 CONT many languages, classic latinity, modern humanistic ideas, and ancient books
1 CONT and the support of new art and science, all familiar since childhood. His
1 CONT education took place partly on battlefields, partly under the control of
1 CONT prominent humanists. He never ceased to learn, supporting all kinds of art,
1 CONT he founded a considerable library -- the famous Corvina. He trusted, like the
1 CONT majority of his contemporaries, in astrology & other semi-scientific beliefs.
